===Noun===
{{en-noun|head=[[millennium]] [[bug]]|-}}

# {{lb|en|computing}} The [[bug]] that arises when a 2‐digit [[year]] system — from "00" to "99", meaning: from 1900 to 1999 — fails to [[display]], [[store]] or [[calculate]] the year 2000.

